{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Only &quot;Infinite Mode&quot; is available in the demo version.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Control your Chihuahua with the Chihuahua Controller!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you step on the arrow, the Chihuahua will move accordingly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you get the flag within the time limit, you can move on to the next stage with extra time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim to collect as many flags as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956880/extras/db5432679ff202268290c00180bc3cc6.poster.avif?t=1756122990\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956880/extras/db5432679ff202268290c00180bc3cc6.webm?t=1756122990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956880/extras/db5432679ff202268290c00180bc3cc6.mp4?t=1756122990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50% of Chihuahua is made up of tremors!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you get a flag, an arrow is added to the Chihuahua Controller!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you handle the ever-increasing number of arrows?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956880/extras/07d272441615427e19bfb9461f925b4c.poster.avif?t=1756122990\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956880/extras/07d272441615427e19bfb9461f925b4c.webm?t=1756122990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956880/extras/07d272441615427e19bfb9461f925b4c.mp4?t=1756122990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50% of Chihuahua is made up of anger!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you touch a thorn, an inaccessible area is added to the Chihuahua Controller!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful not to block your path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956880/extras/43df56c885410e41929d754f066d1fa8.poster.avif?t=1756122990\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956880/extras/43df56c885410e41929d754f066d1fa8.webm?t=1756122990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956880/extras/43df56c885410e41929d754f066d1fa8.mp4?t=1756122990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chihuahua is unpredictable!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the Chihuahua doesn't get the flag, the game will end with \u201ctime's up\u201d!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far can you control Chihuahua? <br>Will the Chihuahua be able to collect 25 flags?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956880/extras/30f80927238558bb1c705f99acb644bd.avif?t=1756122990\" width=757 height=427 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3956880?t=1756122990","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3956880?t=1756122990","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956880/345ff4bb83dc44440e03d31ba1505ddee00a536d/capsul