2441615427e19bfb9461f925b4c.poster.avif?t=1756122990\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956880/extras/07d272441615427e19bfb9461f925b4c.webm?t=1756122990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956880/extras/07d272441615427e19bfb9461f925b4c.mp4?t=1756122990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50% of Chihuahua is made up of anger!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you touch a thorn, an inaccessible area is added to the Chihuahua Controller!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful not to block your path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956880/extras/43df56c885410e41929d754f066d1fa8.poster.avif?t=1756122990\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956880/extras/43df56c885410e41929d754f066d1fa8.webm?t=1756122990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956880/extras/43df56c885410e41929d754f066d1fa8.mp4?t=1756122990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chihuahua is unpredictable!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the Chihuahua doesn't get the flag, the game will end with \u201ctime's up\u201d!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far can you control Chihuahua? <br>Will the Chihuahua be able to collect 25 flags?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956880/extras/30f80927238558bb1c705f99acb644bd.avif?t=1756122990\" width=757 height=427 /></span></p>","developers":["